---
import PageHead from '../components/PageHead.astro';
import TextSection from '../components/TextSection.astro';
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
---

<Site
  title="Privacy"
  description="What The Doorman Fallacy collects when you suggest a case, subscribe or visit, why, and when it is deleted."
>
  <div class="page">
    <PageHead title="Privacy" lead="What this site collects, why, and when it is deleted." />

    <TextSection id="suggest-title" title="If you suggest a case or report an error">
      <p>
        We store the links and note you send. Your name and email are optional. We use your email only to ask
        you about that suggestion, and your name only to credit you if you asked us to. Name and email are
        deleted 90 days after we have looked into the suggestion.
      </p>
    </TextSection>

    <TextSection id="subscribe-title" title="If you subscribe">
      <p>
        We store your email address to send the letter. Until you confirm, the address is deleted after 7
        days. Unsubscribing, from the link in every email, deletes it at once. We send the letter ourselves
        and do not use a newsletter service.
      </p>
    </TextSection>

    <TextSection id="visit-title" title="When you visit">
      <p>
        The site sets no cookies and uses no tracking scripts. Cloudflare, which hosts the site, counts
        visits without cookies and without identifying you. Like any web host, it handles your
        connection&rsquo;s address to deliver the pages. When you send a form, we keep a scrambled form
        of that address (a one-way hash) for one day, only to limit how many forms one connection can
        send in an hour.
      </p>
    </TextSection>

    <TextSection id="where-title" title="Where the data is">
      <p>
        Suggestions and subscriber addresses are stored in a database on Cloudflare, and the emails we send
        go through our own mail service on Cloudflare. Nothing is sold or shared.
      </p>
    </TextSection>

    <TextSection id="rights-title" title="Your rights">
      <p>
        You can ask what we hold about you, and ask us to correct or delete it. Write to{' '}
        <a href="mailto:privacy@thedoormanfallacy.com">privacy@thedoormanfallacy.com</a>. The site is run by
        Mental Audio AS in Oslo, Norway, which is responsible for the data described here.
      </p>
      <p class="t-caption ink-3">Last updated 21 October 2026.</p>
    </TextSection>
  </div>
</Site>
